  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-7a106d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine garlic aioli and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• In a second large bowl, combine panko breadcrumbs, Nan’s special seasoning, garlic & herb seasoning, Parmesan cheese and a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• Toss a handful of cauliflower in the aioli until well coated. Transfer to breadcrumb mixture and toss to coat. Transfer to a lined oven tray, then repeat with remaining cauliflower.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-949a0910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread cauliflower out in a single layer. Bake until golden, 20-25 minutes.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes.\n• Transfer to a plate lined with paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-9293c620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the cauliflower is baking, thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-31c98930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a third large bowl, combine spinach & rocket mix, cucumber, apple and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-22626440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rocket salad between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan and herb crumbed cauliflower, haloumi and any remaining crumbs left on the oven tray.\n• Drizzle over caesar dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594af/step-84807250.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
